From f6428ff4eff91c45ed8850a1deb9ea2a20d7b40e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shripad621git <shripad62001@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:50:17 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(esp32s31): use tinycrypt for br/edr pairing keys

- Add the tinycrypt ECC, SHA-256 and HMAC sources from ESP-IDF
- Build the BR/EDR controller port against tinycrypt instead of PSA
- Use the software ECC path, the ECC peripheral code is not built

The controller creates a P-192 key pair at start-up and asserts when
that fails. TF-PSA-Crypto has no P-192 curve, so the PSA path crashed
at boot on hardware.
